                <pb facs="0408" n="264" xml:id="pg264"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">861.77 Chinese Eastern/164: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >MacMurray</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Peking</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1929-08-01T19:00:00+08:00">August 1, 1929—7
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received August 1—10:58 a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>660. Legation’s 654, July 30, 9 p.m.</p>
                <list>
                    <label>1.</label>
                    <item>Following from Reuter, Nanking, July 31st: <quote rend="blockquote">
                            <p>“The first Sino-Russian preliminary conference met yesterday
                                afternoon at Manchuli, the Harbin Consul General, Melnikov,
                                representing Russia and Mr. Tsai Yun-sheng, Commissioner for Foreign
                                Affairs in Harbin, representing China. It is understood that they
                                discussed questions of time and place for a formal conference.”</p>
                        </quote></item>
                    <label>2.</label>
                    <item>Legation has been able thus far to confirm only the fact that Soviet
                        Consul General requested Chinese Commissioner of Foreign Affairs to meet
                        with him at Manchuli, July 31st.</item>
                    <label>3.</label>
                    <item>Captain Powell, Naval Attaché, has proceeded from Harbin to
                        Manchuli.</item>
                </list>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">MacMurray</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
